    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this. everything is fine on paper. i have a good job, my family is great, i have a house... i should be happy. but it just feels like everything is gray. like i'm just a ghost watching my own life happen. it's just this heavy, empty feeling that never goes away.",
