    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but even just \"drifting\" feels like so much work. it's like i'm constantly carrying this weight around. i just want it to be quiet. i just want the grayness to stop for good, you know? like, is there even a version of this where it actually stays gone?",
